{"id":"A1-L112","title":"Key verb: bring","cefr":"A1","level":"A1","unit":"A1-U07","focus":"Verbo-chave: bring","targets":{"grammar":"Verbo-chave: bring","pron":"/h/ de house","verbs":["enjoy"],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["preparation","road sign","corner shop","newsstand","shopping street","business district","residential area","industrial zone","city limits","outskirts","nature reserve","national park","botanical garden","picnic area"],"field":"Lugares","genre":"Texto acadêmico e resumo","skill":"Escrita","words_min":14},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 112 · Key verb: bring","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Verbo-chave: bring.","**Verbos:** enjoy.","**Pronúncia:** /h/ de house.","**8 palavras novas** (lugares).","**Texto do dia:** texto acadêmico e resumo."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A1):** eu consigo usar bring e enjoy em um texto acadêmico."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você ainda não faz as provas, mas já treina o formato de tarefas curtas que elas usam.","Esta aula treina **escrever frases claras e corretas (IELTS Writing, TOEFL Writing)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["preparation","preparação"],["road sign","road sign"],["corner shop","corner shop"],["newsstand","newsstand"],["shopping street","shopping street"],["business district","business district"],["residential area","residential area"],["industrial zone","industrial zone"],["city limits","city limits"],["outskirts","outskirts"],["nature reserve","nature reserve"],["national park","national park"],["botanical garden","botanical garden"],["picnic area","picnic area"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · An academic summary","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"Summary: What We Bring to Class","paras":["A study asked 100 students: What do you **bring** to class? Most **bring** a notebook and a phone. Some **bring** snacks. Few **bring** a dictionary.","Students who **bring** a notebook **enjoy** learning more. The study concludes that preparation **brings** confidence."],"kicker":"ACADEMIC SUMMARY","by":"Study Skills Group","gloss":[["notebook","caderno"],["preparation","preparação"],["confidence","confiança"],["conclude","concluir"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Most students bring a notebook.","ans":"T","why":"notebook and phone."},{"q":"Many bring a dictionary.","ans":"F","why":"Few."},{"q":"Preparation brings confidence.","ans":"T","why":"brings confidence."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“confidence” means…","opts":["confiança","confusão","coragem só"],"ans":0,"why":"confidence."},{"q":"“conclude” means…","opts":["concluir","começar","explicar"],"ans":0,"why":"conclude."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Key verb: bring","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Uso","Exemplo"],"rows":[["trazer/levar","**Bring a notebook.**"],["causar","**Preparation brings confidence.**"],["bring up","**Don’t bring up the past.**"],["bring × take","**bring** = em direção a mim; **take** = para longe"]],"cap":"Key verb: bring"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Irregular: **bring – brought – brought**."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"I ___ a notebook to class. (bring)","a":"bring","why":"bring."},{"s":"She ___ snacks. (bring)","a":"brings","why":"she → brings."},{"s":"Students who prepare ___ it. (enjoy)","a":"enjoy","why":"enjoy."},{"s":"Preparation ___ confidence. (bring)","a":"brings","why":"causa."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["notebook","caderno"],["preparation","preparação"],["confidence","confiança"],["snack","lanche"],["dictionary","dicionário"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["I","bring","snacks","Can"],"ans":"Can I bring snacks","pt":"Posso levar lanches?"},{"words":["enjoy","snacks","Sure","I"],"ans":"Sure I enjoy snacks","pt":"Claro, adoro lanches!"}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"preparation","pos":"word","pt":"preparação","ex":"Good preparation.","expt":"Boa preparação."},{"w":"road sign","pos":"word","pt":"road sign","ex":"placa de trânsito","expt":"Read the road sign."},{"w":"corner shop","pos":"word","pt":"corner shop","ex":"lojinha de esquina","expt":"A corner shop."},{"w":"newsstand","pos":"word","pt":"newsstand","ex":"banca de jornal","expt":"A newsstand."},{"w":"shopping street","pos":"word","pt":"shopping street","ex":"rua de compras","expt":"A shopping street."},{"w":"business district","pos":"word","pt":"business district","ex":"centro comercial","expt":"The business district."},{"w":"residential area","pos":"word","pt":"residential area","ex":"área residencial","expt":"A residential area."},{"w":"industrial zone","pos":"word","pt":"industrial zone","ex":"zona industrial","expt":"An industrial zone."},{"w":"city limits","pos":"word","pt":"city limits","ex":"limites da cidade","expt":"Outside the city limits."},{"w":"outskirts","pos":"word","pt":"outskirts","ex":"periferia","expt":"The outskirts of town."},{"w":"nature reserve","pos":"word","pt":"nature reserve","ex":"reserva natural","expt":"A nature reserve."},{"w":"national park","pos":"word","pt":"national park","ex":"parque nacional","expt":"A national park."},{"w":"botanical garden","pos":"word","pt":"botanical garden","ex":"jardim botânico","expt":"A botanical garden."},{"w":"picnic area","pos":"word","pt":"picnic area","ex":"área de piquenique","expt":"A picnic area."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**What do I bring to class?** — O que levo para a aula?","**Bring a notebook and a pen.** — Leve caderno e caneta.","**Can I bring snacks?** — Posso levar lanches?","**Can I get a refund?** — Posso ter reembolso?","**My flight was canceled.** — Meu voo foi cancelado.","**I’ve lost my passport.** — Perdi meu passaporte."]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"bring","pt":"trazer","forms":[["I / you / we / they bring","I bring a notebook."],["he / she / it brings","She brings snacks."]]},{"v":"enjoy","pt":"curtir","forms":[["I / you / we / they enjoy","I enjoy learning."],["he / she / it enjoys","She enjoys class."]]}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"Class prep","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"Class prep","lines":[["Ana","What do I bring to class?","O que levo para a aula?"],["Leo","Bring a notebook and a pen.","Leve caderno e caneta."],["Ana","Can I bring snacks?","Posso levar lanches?"],["Leo","Sure, I enjoy snacks!","Claro, adoro lanches!"]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: /h/ de house","items":[{"label":"/h/ de house","note":"O /h/ é um sopro de ar: house, hat, hear.","words":["house","hat","hear","help","home","hello"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Say what you bring to class.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I bring a notebook and a pen."},{"q":"Ask someone to bring something.","pt":"Peça.","model":"Can you bring snacks?"},{"q":"Say what you enjoy.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I enjoy learning English."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write 5 sentences with bring.","model":"I bring a notebook to class. She brings snacks. Can you bring a dictionary? Preparation brings confidence. I enjoy learning.","checklist":["Usei **bring 3 vezes**","Usei **enjoy**","Frases claras"],"words":"5 frases"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “notebook” mean?","opts":["caderno","preparação","lanche"],"ans":0,"why":"**notebook** = caderno."},{"q":"What does “preparation” mean?","opts":["confiança","preparação","dicionário"],"ans":1,"why":"**preparation** = preparação."},{"q":"What does “confidence” mean?","opts":["lanche","aluno","confiança"],"ans":2,"why":"**confidence** = confiança."},{"q":"What does “snack” mean?","opts":["lanche","dicionário","aula"],"ans":0,"why":"**snack** = lanche."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Treine esta habilidade com o formato de tarefas curtas das provas (TOEFL/IELTS).","Leia o enunciado primeiro e procure as palavras-chave."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro professor","body":["Use exemplos reais da vida dos alunos e peça frases próprias.","Corrija o erro mais frequente da aula em grupo, sem expor o aluno.","Retome o conteúdo na aula seguinte com um exercício curto."]}]}]}